ive so chart series\ninherit brand color regardless of theme overrides."},"122":{"id":"/docs/design-tokens/colors-36","page_id":"/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-tokens/colors#sidebar","content":"Application sidebar shell slots (shadcn-compatible). Used by the\nSidebar primitive utilities such as\nbg-sidebar, text-sidebar-foreground, and border-sidebar-border.\nProduct blocks may override individual slots (for example\n[--sidebar:transparent] on the cloud shell)."},"123":{"id":"/docs/design-tokens/colors-37","page_id":"/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-tokens/colors#sidebar","content":"Slot"},"124":{"id":"/docs/design-tokens/colors-38","page_id":"/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-tokens/colors#sidebar","content":"Default alias"},"125":{"id":"/docs/design-tokens/colors-39","page_id":"/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-tokens/colors#sidebar","content":"--sidebar"},"126":{"id":"/docs/design-tokens/colors-40","page_id":"/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-tokens/colors#sidebar","content":"grayscale.100"},"127":{"id":"/docs/design-tokens/colors-41","page_id":"/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-tokens/colors#sidebar","content":"--sidebar-foreground"},"128":{"id":"/docs/design-tokens/colors-42","page_id":"/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-tokens/colors#sidebar","content":"grayscale.900"},"129":{"id":"/docs/design-tokens/colors-43","page_id":"/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-tokens/colors#sidebar","content":"--sidebar-primary"},"130":{"id":"/docs/design-tokens/colors-44","page_id":"/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-tokens/colors#sidebar","content":"primary.500"},"131":{"id":"/docs/design-tokens/colors-45","page_id":"/docs/design-tokens/colo